  "id": "optimal-adjustment",
  "term": "optimal adjustment",
  "definition": "Optimal adjustment is the best possible adaptation by a couple to the stresses and relationship changes linked to one partner’s chronic physical or sensory impairment. In this context, it is supported by seeing the disability as a shared challenge and coping with it together.",
